Verified location: `/root/Witness`

Witness signs observations from physical hardware into verifiable attestations.

UAP should use Witness to distinguish between something an agent claims happened and something supported by a signed observation.

For example, an agent may submit a photograph, sensor reading or simulation comparison. Witness establishes the provenance of the observation, while additional validation determines what that observation actually proves.

A signed camera event is evidence of a capture. It is not automatically proof that every claim made about the image is true.

